\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the thesis pipeline. After shared preprocessing, three independently trained retrieval experts produce CSLS-corrected score matrices, which are $z$-score normalised and combined by a frozen weighted sum to obtain the primary SHARED1000 retrieval endpoint. The fusion is applied only at inference time and only at score level; it does not define a jointly trained model or a unified fused latent embedding. The reconstruction branch is a secondary anchor-dependent add-on conditioned on the retrieved top-1 image and an fMRI-predicted CLIP signal.\relax }}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:thesis_pipeline}{{1.1}{3}{Overview of the thesis pipeline. After shared preprocessing, three independently trained retrieval experts produce CSLS-corrected score matrices, which are $z$-score normalised and combined by a frozen weighted sum to obtain the primary SHARED1000 retrieval endpoint. The fusion is applied only at inference time and only at score level; it does not define a jointly trained model or a unified fused latent embedding. The reconstruction branch is a secondary anchor-dependent add-on conditioned on the retrieved top-1 image and an fMRI-predicted CLIP signal.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.2}{\ignorespaces Single-example decoding path used throughout the thesis. A viewed image defines the target CLIP embedding, the corresponding fMRI response is preprocessed into a voxel vector, and the decoder learns to map that brain activity into the shared latent space used for retrieval-first evaluation and optional downstream generation.\relax }}{4}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:end_to_end_example_pipeline}{{1.2}{4}{Single-example decoding path used throughout the thesis. A viewed image defines the target CLIP embedding, the corresponding fMRI response is preprocessed into a voxel vector, and the decoder learns to map that brain activity into the shared latent space used for retrieval-first evaluation and optional downstream generation.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
